<section class="comments-panel" data-comments data-comments-term="<%= ff_comment_term(page) %>" aria-labelledby="comments-title">
  <div class="comments-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION</span><h2 id="comments-title">一起聊聊</h2></div><a href="https://github.com/FLYFISH567/FLYFISH567.github.io/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub Discussions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <p class="comments-intro">欢迎留下想法。评论由 GitHub Discussions 提供，需要登录 GitHub。</p>
  <p class="comments-status" data-comments-status role="status" aria-live="polite">滚动到这里时加载评论…</p>
  <div data-comments-mount></div>
  <button type="button" class="comments-retry" data-comments-retry hidden>重新加载评论</button>
  <noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后可以在这里查看评论，也可以直接前往 GitHub Discussions。</p></noscript>
</section>
